notes.content:
Game is now available in English, Portuguese and Spanish.
Expanded map, PvP battle, shop system and more!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42348200/3c8e424dc5fff15d492ee8fa9a6a62d127771a5b.png

What's new:

 Scenario redone, bringing new areas to explore;
 New enemies, bosses and skills;
 New player versus player combat;
 New checkpoint save system;
 New shop system;
 Unique songs to each boss;
 Multiple save slots;



Other small system fixes:

 Movement system improved;
 Skill will only be consumed after the first projectile is fired;
 When getting too far or blocked by a wall, unlock aim from the enemy.
